cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Handwritten Meitei Mayek word generation: code, experiments and demonstration"
abstract: >-
  The first diffusion model for handwritten Meitei Mayek, and the first learned generator of
  the script's handwriting. It writes any word in the hand of a writer shown in one to eight
  reference word images, and is trained only on pseudo-writers composed from the isolated
  characters of TUMMHCD. The repository holds the generator, its training and evaluation code,
  the notebooks, the demonstration and the tests.
authors:
